# A misaligned heater: the waveguide sits on the flank of the temperature profile.
# Reference: the same mesh solved with a sparse direct solver in SciPy.
title Heater displaced 1 um sideways
grid dx=0.25 dy=0.25
window width=60 ymin=-10 ymax=5
layer si -10 0
layer sio2 0 5
rect si -0.25 0.25 2 2.25
rect tin 0 2 4 4.25
heater h xmin=0 xmax=2 ymin=4 ymax=4.25 power=0.1
probe wg xmin=-0.25 xmax=0.25 ymin=2 ymax=2.25
expect response wg h 160.845147 1e-7
expect pi_power wg h 25.904833 1e-7
expect peak 41.4702252 1e-7
expect balance 1e-9
expect cells 14400
